                <pb facs="0161" n="77" xml:id="pg77"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-09-12"><hi rendition="#italic">September 12,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Replying to Mr. Conger’s telegrams on the subject, Mr. Adee states that the
                    draft article substituting An-tung instead of Ta-tung-kou is approved; and that
                    this change is gratifying.)</p>
            </div>
